— HALLOWEEN: a Halloween chest on the home screen with the “13” set — frames, living badges and gifts. Until November 1.

— SHARED FEED: Shorts, TikTok, Rutube, VK and Dzen together, clips from both of your feeds in turns, with chat and a call. Whoever has Togetherly+ starts it, the partner joins by invitation.

— The WATCH screen is redrawn, and in fullscreen the chat no longer covers the video.

— Memories with videos, music, books, movies and places got a redesign. Clips from the shared feed can be saved to your memories.

— You can now add a note to any gift. A chest prize can be sent to friends as a nice card (the “Share” button).

— A morning reminder tells you the chest is full again; you can turn it off in notifications.

— The app now speaks Chinese.

— Fixed: ads for the chest and the streak sometimes didn’t count, on iPhone taps were lost in the watch room after an ad, and the app crashed on phones without Google services.
